sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Usuario
    participant EX as server.js (Express)
    participant DJ as Django

    U->>EX: credenciales + reCAPTCHA
    EX->>DJ: POST /api/hash_login/
    DJ->>DJ: validar_recaptcha + authenticate + crear JWT
    DJ-->>EX: token_drf + JWT (5 min)
    Note over EX: token_drf → localStorage · JWT → memoria RAM

    loop Cada request
        EX->>EX: ¿JWT expira en menos de 2 min?
        alt sí
            EX->>DJ: POST /api/hash_refresh/ {token_drf}
            DJ-->>EX: nuevo JWT (5 min)
        end
        EX->>DJ: request con JWT válido
        DJ-->>U: response
    end
